[2026-03-14T23:01:33.110Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BwX14LrubvraZSRrdGYU1V","type":"tool_result","content":"304:#### Test: Resetting filters shows all properties\n305-- **Initial state:** User is on the home page with multiple filters applied (price range, bedrooms, amenities).\n306-- **Action:** User resets or clears all filter values back to their defaults (e.g., via a \"Clear Filters\" or \"Reset\" button, or manually resetting each).\n307-- **Expected:** The property grid returns to showing all properties (unfiltered). All filter controls return to their default states.\n308-\n309-#### Test: Filters panel controls are functional on repeated use\n--\n618:- **Expected:** Only the confirmed and pending future bookings are displayed. Completed and cancelled bookings are not shown in this tab.\n619-\n620-#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n621-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has completed bookings.\n622-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n623-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"completed\". Upcoming and cancelled bookings are not shown.\n--\n635:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n636-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no completed bookings.\n637-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n638-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab content area displays a message like \"No past trips\" or \"You don't have any past trips yet.\" instead of an empty list.\n639-\n640-#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n--\n867:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Confirmed status\n868-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n869-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Confirmed\" status filter.\n870-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"confirmed\" are shown. Other bookings are hidden.\n871-\n872:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Completed status\n873-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n874-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Completed\" status filter.\n875-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"completed\" are shown.\n876-\n877:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Cancelled status\n878-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n879-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" status filter.\n880-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"cancelled\" are shown.\n881-\n882:#### Test: Resetting filter to All shows all bookings\n883-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with the \"Pending\" filter active.\n884-- **Action:** User clicks the \"All\" filter.\n885-- **Expected:** All bookings across all statuses are displayed again.\n886-\n887:#### Test: Status filters work on repeated use\n888-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n889-- **Action:** User clicks \"Pending\", then \"Confirmed\", then \"All\", then \"Completed\".\n890-- **Expected:** Each filter correctly shows the appropriate subset of bookings. The active filter indicator updates correctly each time.\n891-\n892-#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n--\n917:#### Test: Completed and cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n918-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. Bookings exist with statuses \"completed\" and \"cancelled\".\n919-- **Expected:** Booking rows with \"completed\" or \"cancelled\" status do not display \"Confirm\" or \"Cancel\" action buttons. Only pending and confirmed bookings show action buttons.\n920-\n921:#### Test: Bookings tab shows empty state when no bookings exist\n922-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with properties but no bookings.\n923-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Bookings\" tab.\n924-- **Expected:** The tab displays an empty state message (e.g., \"No bookings yet\").\n925-\n926:#### Test: Status badges display correct colors\n927-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with bookings in all four statuses.\n928-- **Expected:** Status badges use the correct colors: \"Pending\" has a yellow badge, \"Confirmed\" has a green badge, \"Cancelled\" has a red badge, \"Completed\" has a blue badge.\n929-\n930-#### Test: Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n931-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with three pending bookings."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d15d4d9a-a65f-4d36-8b15-78c930eaa7a0","uuid":"c277fe7d-a56e-4053-ae81-8e07f51f095e","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"304:#### Test: Resetting filters shows all properties\n305-- **Initial state:** User is on the home page with multiple filters applied (price range, bedrooms, amenities).\n306-- **Action:** User resets or clears all filter values back to their defaults (e.g., via a \"Clear Filters\" or \"Reset\" button, or manually resetting each).\n307-- **Expected:** The property grid returns to showing all properties (unfiltered). All filter controls return to their default states.\n308-\n309-#### Test: Filters panel controls are functional on repeated use\n--\n618:- **Expected:** Only the confirmed and pending future bookings are displayed. Completed and cancelled bookings are not shown in this tab.\n619-\n620-#### Test: Switching to Past tab shows completed bookings\n621-- **Initial state:** User is logged in and on the My Trips page with the \"Upcoming\" tab selected. The user has completed bookings.\n622-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n623-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab becomes selected/highlighted. The content area updates to show only bookings with status \"completed\". Upcoming and cancelled bookings are not shown.\n--\n635:#### Test: Tab shows empty state when no bookings exist for that category\n636-- **Initial state:** User is logged in with no completed bookings.\n637-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Past\" tab.\n638-- **Expected:** The \"Past\" tab content area displays a message like \"No past trips\" or \"You don't have any past trips yet.\" instead of an empty list.\n639-\n640-#### Test: Upcoming tab empty state message\n--\n867:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Confirmed status\n868-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n869-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Confirmed\" status filter.\n870-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"confirmed\" are shown. Other bookings are hidden.\n871-\n872:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Completed status\n873-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n874-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Completed\" status filter.\n875-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"completed\" are shown.\n876-\n877:#### Test: Filtering bookings by Cancelled status\n878-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n879-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Cancelled\" status filter.\n880-- **Expected:** Only bookings with status \"cancelled\" are shown.\n881-\n882:#### Test: Resetting filter to All shows all bookings\n883-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with the \"Pending\" filter active.\n884-- **Action:** User clicks the \"All\" filter.\n885-- **Expected:** All bookings across all statuses are displayed again.\n886-\n887:#### Test: Status filters work on repeated use\n888-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with various bookings.\n889-- **Action:** User clicks \"Pending\", then \"Confirmed\", then \"All\", then \"Completed\".\n890-- **Expected:** Each filter correctly shows the appropriate subset of bookings. The active filter indicator updates correctly each time.\n891-\n892-#### Test: Host can confirm a pending booking\n--\n917:#### Test: Completed and cancelled bookings have no action buttons\n918-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host on the Bookings tab. Bookings exist with statuses \"completed\" and \"cancelled\".\n919-- **Expected:** Booking rows with \"completed\" or \"cancelled\" status do not display \"Confirm\" or \"Cancel\" action buttons. Only pending and confirmed bookings show action buttons.\n920-\n921:#### Test: Bookings tab shows empty state when no bookings exist\n922-- **Initial state:** User is logged in as a host with properties but no bookings.\n923-- **Action:** User clicks the \"Bookings\" tab.\n924-- **Expected:** The tab displays an empty state message (e.g., \"No bookings yet\").\n925-\n926:#### Test: Status badges display correct colors\n927-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with bookings in all four statuses.\n928-- **Expected:** Status badges use the correct colors: \"Pending\" has a yellow badge, \"Confirmed\" has a green badge, \"Cancelled\" has a red badge, \"Completed\" has a blue badge.\n929-\n930-#### Test: Confirm and cancel actions work on repeated use\n931-- **Initial state:** User is on the Bookings tab with three pending bookings.","numLines":63}}
